<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/Vulnerability/26c8aede0886> a airo:Vulnerability ;
    rdfs:label "algorithm fails to account for job rotation and dynamic frontline exposure" ;
    airo:confidenceScore "0.95"^^xsd:float ;
    airo:extractionMode "abstracted" ;
    airo:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/3ceec3ac3206> ;
    airo:hasSourceDocument <https://w3id.org/airo/incident/document/1588> .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/009ad2717b92> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[1588] The algorithm’s third category refers to the California Department of Public Health’s vaccine allocation guidelines." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1588" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/022eb68f6977> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[1588] “Our algorithm, that the ethicists, infectious disease experts worked on for weeks … clearly didn’t work right,” Tim Morrison, the director of the ambulatory care team, told residents at the event in a video posted online." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1588" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/0a0596b0c143> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[1588] When resident physicians at Stanford Medical Center—many of whom work on the front lines of the covid-19 pandemic—found out that only seven out of over 1,300 of them had been prioritized for the first 5,000 doses of the covid vaccine, they were shocked." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1588" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/11240c3f68b2> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[1588] Elsewhere, the University of California San Francisco’s plan is based on a similar assessment of risk of exposure to the virus." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1588" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/201b8847bf2b> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[1588] “1 of the core attractions of algorithms is that they allow the powerful to blame a black box for politically unattractive outcomes for which they would otherwise be responsible,” Roger McNamee, a prominent Silicon Valley insider turned critic, wrote on Twitter." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1588" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/209ba1110bc4> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[1588] Kahn, who sat on Johns Hopkins’ 20-member committee on vaccine allocation, says his university allocated vaccines based simply on job and risk of exposure to covid-19." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1588" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/264303d23908> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[1205] Dr. Mary Hawn, chair of the department of surgery, confessed to being \"disturbed and puzzled\" by the vaccination roster that \"included many of the medical staff list that aren't our physicians on the front line.\"" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1205" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/2908acb793bc> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[1205] \"We take complete responsibility for the errors in the execution of our vaccine distribution plan,\" said Lisa Kim, a Stanford Medicine spokesperson." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1205" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/2c088a6d8fc1> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Stanford algorithm decided to vaccinate only seven of its frontline COVID-19 workers, out of 5,000 doses" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1530" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/35e37f7a57d2> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Stanford apologizes for coronavirus vaccine plan that left out many front-line doctors" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1275" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/3886273ded1e> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "No specific evidence provided in the sentences about Santa Clara County's role." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1588" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/3aa922d3627d> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[1588] Mass General Brigham in Boston categorizes employees into four groups based on department and job location, according to an internal email reviewed by MIT Technology Review." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1588" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/3c44c61eda88> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[1205] Stanford Medicine leadership has since apologized and promised to re-evaluate the plan." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1205" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/44301743885c> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Only Seven of Stanford’s First 5,000 Vaccines Were Designated for Medical Residents" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1205" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/4ed2e2c14b37> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[1588] Mass General Brigham in Boston categorizes employees into four groups based on department and job location, according to an internal email reviewed by MIT Technology Review." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1588" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/551a5889f754> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[1205] said Dr. Sarah Johnson, a third-year OB-GYN resident who has delivered babies from COVID-positive patients during the pandemic." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1205" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/5c414e30304a> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[1588] “Our algorithm, that the ethicists, infectious disease experts worked on for weeks … clearly didn’t work right,” Tim Morrison, the director of the ambulatory care team, told residents at the event in a video posted online." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1588" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/5eea0d527dbb> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[1205] Stanford Medicine leadership has since apologized and promised to re-evaluate the plan." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1205" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/6b9f310402fc> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[1588] Kahn, who sat on Johns Hopkins’ 20-member committee on vaccine allocation, says his university allocated vaccines based simply on job and risk of exposure to covid-19." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1588" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/6f66184376de> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[1588] “Our algorithm, that the ethicists, infectious disease experts worked on for weeks … clearly didn’t work right,” Tim Morrison, the director of the ambulatory care team, told residents at the event in a video posted online." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1588" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/73c3b63d46e0> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[1588] Mass General Brigham in Boston categorizes employees into four groups based on department and job location, according to an internal email reviewed by MIT Technology Review." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1588" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/798929e4944b> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[1588] Kahn, who sat on Johns Hopkins’ 20-member committee on vaccine allocation, says his university allocated vaccines based simply on job and risk of exposure to covid-19." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1588" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/7cb1f76e2fde> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[1588] And, as first reported by ProPublica, residents were told that because they rotate between departments rather than maintain a single assignment, they lost out on points associated with the departments where they worked." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1588" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/820d7aae987e> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[1588] Elsewhere, the University of California San Francisco’s plan is based on a similar assessment of risk of exposure to the virus." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1588" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/8d466b0e707d> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[1205] In response to the residents' protests, Dr. Niraj Sehgal, chief medical officer, sent an email saying, \"Please know that the perceived lack of priority for residents and fellows was not the intent at all.\"" ;
